  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "calendar-1",
   "text": "Meanwhile, the calendar breaks.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 1.972,
   "sha256": "9a807f0f407773a3db60252e2694211bff5acdc8ec82ec10f71ad47dbeb1485a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "calendar-2",
   "text": "But every day gets shorter, so a year contains more days.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 4.446,
   "sha256": "99e2e38a8910b1773a56a151f251f55ef162aba947b74f06385c1f6937ebf9f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "calendar-3",
   "text": "Right now, at a six hour day, a year already holds about fourteen hundred and sixty days.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.214,
   "sha256": "43ebded2b1f43bd4170bb11cc0514fb92d539ecc179c9d42a179b98ce915e283"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "calendar-4",
   "text": "By the end, it would hold over six thousand, with a sunrise every eighty-four minutes, and you would be asked to sleep eight times a day.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 9.632,
   "sha256": "9a0607cfffb89cb889610f7c53dd9982a40785d6893c1cc94c196462abba4696"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "poles-1",
   "text": "At the poles, the ground only turns on the spot.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 3.341,
   "sha256": "9c02455ce5c0c2055ece839bff43b6b6348feef9e86d9a29f677e379ce7b85e6"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "poles-2",
   "text": "Nobody there is carried around at all, and they would weigh the same as ever.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 5.218,
   "sha256": "931136cad6729324ca761a83ebc4cf4550882f993fd19f5477fbdd7f91a20d39"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "poles-3",
   "text": "At forty-five degrees north, you move at seventy percent of the equator's speed, and the push outward is only half as strong.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 9.356,
   "sha256": "76d1d91a86fe29b4322077772c425b8bddae7e6caf7e640c908f95d9f7ca05bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "poles-4",
   "text": "The farther you stand from the equator, the longer you keep your weight.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 4.756,
   "sha256": "405cfd42652fa8d14da5727c73f6ec4a9e77d77a104bc20f680a1db12ce1263b"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "cta",
